# {{PROJECT_NAME}} — Communication Protocol

This project uses loom's [Seam Artifact Protocol](https://github.com/zentetsukenz/agent) so context
survives when ownership changes hands between agents/sessions. It is the shared contract every agent
and skill that hands off context references — read it before producing or discovering a handoff.

